001A65  3                                               ; OK, Y OFFSET IS IN PTEMPW1, X IS IN PTEMPW
001A65  3  A9 A0                LDA     #$A0            ; ADD THE MEMORY OFFSET TO PTEMPW (BECAUSE IT IS EASY)
001A67  3  8D DF 16             STA     PTEMPW+1        ; THEN ADD PTEMPW1 TO PTEMPW THAT SHOULD BE THE MEMORY ADDRESS TO UPDATE
001A6A  3                                               ;
001A6A  3  18                   CLC                     ; Clear the Carry flag before the first addition
001A6B  3  AD DE 16             LDA     PTEMPW          ; Load the low byte of the first number into the accumulator
