001A76  3  6D E1 16             ADC     PTEMPW1+1       ; Add the high byte of the second number (plus carry from previous op)
001A79  3  85 FE                STA     TEMPW+1         ; Store the high byte of the result
001A7B  3                                               ; PTEMPW IS THE MEMORY OFFSET TO UPDATE
